{"id":"19.03.DiagonalLine","contentHtml":"<p>This project is my solo work, in which I developed from scratch both a unique game concept and its technically complex visual embodiment.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As a <strong>Solo Developer</strong>, I was responsible for 100% of the implementation: from idea and gameplay to 2D art and shader creation.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The key task was to <strong>support the original <code>one-tap</code> mechanics with a unique, technically complex visual style</strong>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<p>To create a cohesive gaming experience, I developed several interconnected systems. The entire visual style was implemented using shaders <strong>created in the visual editor <code>Shader Forge</code></strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Mechanics:</strong> Implemented gameplay where the player with one tap <strong>\"dives\" through a diagonal line to the other side</strong>, finding empty \"windows\" between obstacles.</li>\n<li><strong>Illusion of Depth:</strong> <strong><code>Normal Maps</code></strong> were created for 2D obstacle sprites. The character acts as a light source, which, flying by, realistically illuminates them, creating an illusion of volume.</li>\n<li><strong><code>Retrowave</code> Post-Effect:</strong> A custom post-processing shader was written that simulates the style of the 80s, adding the effect of <strong>vertical scan lines</strong> and color correction.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cohesive Product:</strong> Created a prototype with original core mechanics and a strong, technically developed visual style.</li>\n<li><strong>Key Competency:</strong> The project demonstrates my ability to work <strong>at the intersection of gameplay programming and technical art</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Expertise in Rendering:</strong> Demonstrated understanding of the logic of both object shaders and full-screen post-effects.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Diagonal Line","date":"2019-03","type":"project","tagsArray":["Mobile","Unity","C#","Photoshop","HLSL","Shader Forge"],"heroVideo":["plK6NCGS8a4"],"shortDescription":"<p>Solo project with original <code>one-tap</code> mechanics, where the <strong>unique visual style</strong> was created using custom shaders.</p>\n","role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/19.03.DiagonalLine/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/19.03.DiagonalLine/card.video?v=1765111482809&webm=1&mp4=1","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/19.03.DiagonalLine/screenshots/1.webp","width":530,"height":938},{"src":"/images/projects/19.03.DiagonalLine/screenshots/2.webp","width":530,"height":938},{"src":"/images/projects/19.03.DiagonalLine/screenshots/3.webp","width":530,"height":938},{"src":"/images/projects/19.03.DiagonalLine/screenshots/4.webp","width":530,"height":938}]}